{"unit_id":"LanFeng97__dsh-workspace-create-dialog#card-zh","repo":"LanFeng97/dsh-workspace-create-dialog","commit":"7c4d0ef91a0ad9d49efa71ec5a637a53e6d87b2f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-create-dialog 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的工作区创建对话框，接入侧边栏和空状态页的目录流程。用户可以输入名称直接创建同名文件夹，也可以选择已有文件夹作为工作区；名称为空时会从文件夹名自动补齐。对话框还允许设置只输入名称时使用的新建位置，并记住上次选择的目录以便下次打开。支持校验工作区名称、显示创建错误并保留交互状态；原生文件夹选择器依赖 Windows PowerShell。适合经常新建项目目录、希望在 DSH 中直接完成工作区配置的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:435-475","lib/index.js:248-295","lib/name.js:26-35"]}
{"unit_id":"LanFeng97__dsh-workspace-create-dialog#card-en","repo":"LanFeng97/dsh-workspace-create-dialog","commit":"7c4d0ef91a0ad9d49efa71ec5a637a53e6d87b2f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-workspace-create-dialog adds a workspace dialog to DSH web. Type a name to create its folder, or choose a folder. Set the parent location for named workspaces; the chooser remembers the last folder. It validates names and shows errors. The native chooser requires Windows PowerShell.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:435-475","lib/index.js:248-295","lib/name.js:26-35"]}
